Z||000000||Alex2004||01-21-2001||10:03 PM||||Whenever i turn any lights on, the RPM drops alot, not to the point to where it almost dies, but just get quiet for a second and then is almost back to where it was until you release the brakes or whatever light it is.  The heater alos does the same thing.  My dad seems to think it is probably an altinator.  What do you guys think it is?  If it is an altinator, how much does a new one cost.  It is a 84 SE 4cyl auto, all options except power mirrors if that matters. LMK, Thanks!<P>Alex||||reg||4
